# Orphaned SQLite shared-memory files that arrive with a catalog copied off a
# FUSE mount (an Unraid user share is one). FUSE will not unlink a file another
# handle still holds, so it renames it to .fuse_hiddenXXXXXXXX and cleans up on
# the last close; a killed process or a dropped mount leaves it behind forever.
# They have no extension, so the three lines above never covered them.
.fuse_hidden*

# GitLab Runner leftovers. The runner service's --working-directory points at
# this repo, so without an absolute builds_dir/cache_dir in its config.toml it
# drops its checkouts and its local cache straight into the working tree.
/builds/
/cache/

# Agent-session build dir + local brainstorm/SDD scratch
/target-agent/
.superpowers/
scripts/__pycache__/

# Per-machine Claude Code permissions (paths bound to one machine)
.claude/settings.local.json
